{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"queryobserver","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserver"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserver"},{"type":"text","value":" can be used to observe and switch between queries."}]},{"type":"code","value":"const observer = new QueryObserver(queryClient, { queryKey: ['posts'] })\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe((result) => {\n  console.log(result)\n  unsubscribe()\n})","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Options"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The options for the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryObserver"},{"type":"text","value":" are exactly the same as those of "},{"type":"link","href":"../../framework/react/reference/useQuery","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"queryobserver","text":"QueryObserver","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n## `QueryObserver`\n\nThe `QueryObserver` can be used to observe and switch between queries.\n\n```tsx\nconst observer = new QueryObserver(queryClient, { queryKey: ['posts'] })\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe((result) => {\n  console.log(result)\n  unsubscribe()\n})\n```\n\n**Options**\n\nThe options for the `QueryObserver` are exactly the same as those of [`useQuery`](../../framework/react/reference/useQuery).\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueryObserver\ntitle: QueryObserver\n---\n\n## `QueryObserver`\n\nThe `QueryObserver` can be used to observe and switch between queries.\n\n```tsx\nconst observer = new QueryObserver(queryClient, { queryKey: ['posts'] })\n\nconst unsubscribe = observer.subscribe((result) => {\n  console.log(result)\n  unsubscribe()\n})\n```\n\n**Options**\n\nThe options for the `QueryObserver` are exactly the same as those of [`useQuery`](../../framework/react/reference/useQuery).\n"}
